### ========================================
### 🚀 PRUEBA RÁPIDA: Rutas Tentativas
### ========================================

### ✅ GENERAR RUTAS TENTATIVAS - Córdoba → Buenos Aires
POST http://localhost:8095/api/rutas/tentativas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitudOrigen": -31.4201,
  "longitudOrigen": -64.1888,
  "latitudDestino": -34.6037,
  "longitudDestino": -58.3816
}

### ========================================
### 📝 NOTAS IMPORTANTES:
### ========================================
#
# ⚠️ ASEGÚRATE DE:
# 1. Incluir el header: Content-Type: application/json
# 2. El cuerpo debe ser JSON válido
# 3. El microservicio ms-Rutas debe estar corriendo en puerto 8095
#
# Si usas Postman:
# - Method: POST
# - URL: http://localhost:8095/api/rutas/tentativas
# - Headers: Content-Type = application/json
# - Body: (raw, JSON)
#
# Si usas curl:
# curl -X POST http://localhost:8095/api/rutas/tentativas \
#   -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
#   -d "{\"latitudOrigen\":-31.4201,\"longitudOrigen\":-64.1888,\"latitudDestino\":-34.6037,\"longitudDestino\":-58.3816}"
#
### ========================================

